/* ── 레이아웃 v2: 항목 컬럼 확장 + 항목 내 화면이동·인터랙션 + 상세내용 하단 카드 ── */
.items{max-width:820px;min-width:300px;}
.itm-nav{margin-top:9px;padding-top:7px;border-top:1px dashed #e2e8f0;}
.nav-tag{display:inline-block;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#1d4ed8;background:#e8eefb;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 6px;margin-bottom:4px;letter-spacing:.03em;}
/* 이동표(진입·전역 이동 / 화면 이동·인터랙션): 회색 격자 + 글자수에 맞춘 열 폭 (2026-09-02) */
.itm-nav,.nav-global{display:grid;grid-template-columns:fit-content(200px) fit-content(160px) minmax(150px,1fr);}
.nav-tag,.nav-global-title,.nav-note{grid-column:1/-1;justify-self:start;}
.nav-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:subgrid;grid-column:1/-1;gap:0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;padding:0;align-items:stretch;}
.nav-row>span{padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #d4d4d4;border-right:1px solid #d4d4d4;}
.nav-row>span:first-child{border-left:1px solid #d4d4d4;}
.nav-row:not(.nav-row + .nav-row)>span{border-top:1px solid #d4d4d4;}
@supports not (grid-template-columns:subgrid){
  .itm-nav,.nav-global{display:block;}
  .nav-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(84px,26%) 1fr minmax(96px,30%);}
}
.nav-el{color:var(--text);font-weight:600;}
.nav-act{color:var(--text);}
.nav-act strong{color:var(--text);}
.nav-to{color:var(--text);font-weight:700;}
.nav-to::before{content:'→ ';color:#94a3b8;font-weight:400;}
.nav-to.stay{color:var(--text);font-weight:600;}
.nav-global{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px 8px;margin-bottom:4px;}
.nav-global-title{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;}
.detail-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(420px,1fr));gap:10px 18px;}
.detail-grid .dtl{padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #eee;border-left:3px solid #e8eefb;border-radius:8px;min-height:0;cursor:pointer;}
.detail-grid .dtl.active{border-left-color:var(--accent);background:#f5f8ff;border-radius:8px;}
.dtl-num{display:inline-flex;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#e0e0e0;color:#888;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:7px;vertical-align:-3px;transition:all .2s;}
.dtl.active .dtl-num{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;}
.detail-grid .detail-label{margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;}
.nav-note{font-size:11px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.65;margin-top:6px;padding-top:6px;border-top:1px solid #eef2f7;}
.nav-note strong{color:var(--text);}

